      "summary": "Prepare the Brussels sprouts",
      "instruction": "Trim the base of each sprout, remove any yellowed outer leaves, and halve them lengthways. Cut the bacon rashers into small pieces (lardons). Place the sprouts on a baking tray, drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and pepper, and toss to coat. Scatter the bacon pieces over the top.",
